WEBVTT

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:07.210
If I miss my curfew,
Father will yell at me again!

00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:14.820
Ow...

00:00:25.230 --> 00:00:26.230
Are you okay?

00:00:26.850 --> 00:00:30.690
Y-Yes... I think I just
sprained it a little...

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:31.790
Don't move.

00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:41.760
What in the...?

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:42.850
Try standing up.

00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:47.750
--It doesn't hurt.
--That's good.

00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:50.340
Ah, I can put my shoes on myself...

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:54.110
There you go.

00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:59.990
What did you do? Was that
some trick? Or magic?

00:01:01.660 --> 00:01:02.410
Bye.

00:01:07.440 --> 00:01:09.060
Please wait!

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:10.860
What's your name?

00:01:13.560 --> 00:01:14.270
I'm Brad.

00:01:15.220 --> 00:01:16.490
Brad...

00:01:17.770 --> 00:01:20.800
Can we meet again?

00:01:29.410 --> 00:01:30.620
Sorry!

00:03:23.090 --> 00:03:24.200
Do you understand me, Angelina?!

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:26.570
I forbid you to see that man anymore!

00:03:26.570 --> 00:03:29.260
Why?! Brad is such a good person!

00:03:29.260 --> 00:03:31.850
I don't care. You are not to meet him!

00:03:31.850 --> 00:03:34.040
And you'll stay in this room until
you promise me that you won't!

00:03:37.380 --> 00:03:39.070
This is for your own good.

00:03:39.590 --> 00:03:40.810
I'm counting on you.

00:03:40.810 --> 00:03:42.420
Understood, sir.

00:03:46.690 --> 00:03:48.110
Brad...

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:03.060
This darn thing!

00:04:03.060 --> 00:04:05.490
Hey, give it a rest.

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:07.930
You can mess around
with that broken TV all day,

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:11.820
but it's not like some genie's gonna
pop out and grant you three wishes.

00:04:13.290 --> 00:04:15.670
And today is the final episode...

00:04:15.670 --> 00:04:17.590
Well, that's too bad.

00:04:18.240 --> 00:04:20.700
Me, I'm bummed too, 'cuz
my nap's been interrupted.

00:04:22.380 --> 00:04:24.350
Go and buy a new one now!

00:04:24.350 --> 00:04:25.520
If I had the cash...

00:04:26.150 --> 00:04:29.150
How in the world do you blow
through all your money so fast?!

00:04:30.070 --> 00:04:33.060
I got that demonic woman
collecting loans from me,

00:04:33.060 --> 00:04:36.520
and a tightfisted slave-driver
for an agent...

00:04:37.100 --> 00:04:39.040
Who's tightfisted?

00:04:39.040 --> 00:04:42.350
What's up? Here with some more
jobs that won't make me any money?

00:04:42.350 --> 00:04:46.330
Nope. I only bring jobs that pay out.

00:04:46.330 --> 00:04:48.660
On the condition that they're done right...

00:04:49.930 --> 00:04:52.270
Hey, Morrison. Can you fix a TV?

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:53.050
A TV?

00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:57.140
It's broke, and today's the last
episode of "Bolero in Spring"!

00:04:57.140 --> 00:04:59.260
You got your car here today, Morrison?

00:04:59.260 --> 00:04:59.900
Yeah.

00:05:01.290 --> 00:05:05.760
I'll take the job if you let me
get some sleep in it on the way.

00:05:06.230 --> 00:05:09.220
I've been losing sleep due to that broken TV.

00:05:13.130 --> 00:05:14.700
Let's get going already.

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:19.310
I don't care where to, as long as I don't
have to hear any whining about that TV...

00:05:19.310 --> 00:05:21.230
Good day, Miss.

00:05:22.020 --> 00:05:24.210
You're not going to fix the TV, Morrison?

00:05:24.540 --> 00:05:28.060
You can have Dante buy you one
with the money he makes from this job.

00:05:28.060 --> 00:05:30.350
Wait, Morrison!

00:05:30.350 --> 00:05:34.210
That won't be in time for the last
episode of "Bolero in Spring"!

00:05:34.210 --> 00:05:38.210
Hey! You jerks!

00:06:00.500 --> 00:06:03.890
Miss, your meal is ready.

00:06:03.890 --> 00:06:05.250
I don't want to eat.

00:06:05.900 --> 00:06:10.160
Please Miss... If you don't, I'll
be in trouble with your father.

00:06:10.980 --> 00:06:13.710
This is a pretty swank pad.

00:06:13.710 --> 00:06:17.320
What kind of racket does he run
to afford something like this?

00:06:17.320 --> 00:06:19.850
He's the mayor of Capulet City.

00:06:20.680 --> 00:06:25.430
Hello, sorry I'm late. That meeting
dragged out longer than I thought it would...

00:06:25.430 --> 00:06:28.350
Thanks for coming. I'm Mike Hagel.

00:06:28.350 --> 00:06:29.430
I'm Morrison.

00:06:29.430 --> 00:06:30.430
Nice to meet you.

00:06:34.600 --> 00:06:39.190
Let's skip the formalities, and get down
to business before I fall asleep again.

00:06:39.570 --> 00:06:40.410
Huh?

00:06:40.410 --> 00:06:42.000
You got my word. He's good...

00:06:42.490 --> 00:06:44.790
Even if he is a little
rough around the edges.

00:06:53.210 --> 00:06:55.780
I want this man killed.

00:06:56.660 --> 00:06:59.250
Please... Kill him.

00:07:02.450 --> 00:07:06.290
I've got a daughter, my only child.
Her name is Angelina.

00:07:07.110 --> 00:07:12.910
My wife died a long time ago, and since then
I've raised my little darling all on my own.

00:07:13.560 --> 00:07:16.690
My daughter means everything to me.

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:23.420
And this Brad guy is planning on taking my
daughter away from this town and from me!

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:29.970
I won't allow this worthless drifter to just run
off with my daughter because he feels like it.

00:07:30.670 --> 00:07:33.270
And so you want me to kill him?

00:07:33.270 --> 00:07:35.970
Well, that sure makes for a grand story...

00:07:36.450 --> 00:07:39.890
Turn it into a soap opera
and Patty would love it.

00:07:43.410 --> 00:07:44.500
Um...

00:07:44.500 --> 00:07:46.110
Miss.

00:07:46.110 --> 00:07:48.350
I think I should at least be
able to use the washroom alone.

00:08:00.760 --> 00:08:05.650
Did you know that there's some murderer
on the loose in Capulet City recently?

00:08:06.270 --> 00:08:07.850
It's been all over the news.

00:08:08.580 --> 00:08:10.770
My TV's broke, remember?

00:08:10.770 --> 00:08:12.200
Oh yeah...

00:08:12.870 --> 00:08:15.900
At any rate, there have been such incidents.

00:08:15.900 --> 00:08:17.040
This is it.

00:08:18.320 --> 00:08:24.050
It's so gruesome, there are even some
people saying that the culprit isn't human.

00:08:24.700 --> 00:08:26.180
Not human?

00:08:27.310 --> 00:08:32.280
These random assaults started happening right
around the time that this Brad guy showed up.

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:39.760
So you're saying that this "Brad"
isn't just a murderer, but a devil?

00:08:39.760 --> 00:08:41.100
That's ridiculous.

00:08:41.610 --> 00:08:43.530
I saw it with my own eyes.

00:09:09.550 --> 00:09:13.550
There's no doubt about it. He's a devil!

00:09:13.550 --> 00:09:16.050
Right up your alley, don't you think?

00:09:16.440 --> 00:09:19.310
I'm begging you! Kill this Brad!

00:09:33.400 --> 00:09:34.110
Brad...

00:09:35.570 --> 00:09:36.820
Brad!

00:09:38.230 --> 00:09:41.150
Please! Let's run away together!

00:09:43.020 --> 00:09:44.870
What's wrong all of a sudden?

00:09:47.480 --> 00:09:49.220
Try to calm yourself down
and tell me what's going on.

00:09:50.370 --> 00:09:55.180
I think my father has hired someone...

00:09:55.580 --> 00:09:56.810
to kill you!

00:09:57.180 --> 00:09:58.300
Kill me?

00:09:58.830 --> 00:10:01.450
But why?

00:10:01.450 --> 00:10:04.700
Because of your strange power!

00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:08.760
My father thinks you're a devil!

00:10:11.620 --> 00:10:12.480
Does he now...

00:10:12.960 --> 00:10:15.020
Let's run away together!

00:10:15.380 --> 00:10:16.650
Angelina...

00:10:19.830 --> 00:10:23.260
I'm sorry, but I can't let you
get wrapped up in all of this.

00:10:23.260 --> 00:10:24.470
But I...

00:10:24.470 --> 00:10:26.790
Don't worry about me, Angelina.

00:10:27.270 --> 00:10:28.380
I'll be all right.

00:10:28.820 --> 00:10:31.870
Someday your father will understand, too.

00:10:32.260 --> 00:10:32.890
But...

00:10:34.060 --> 00:10:37.200
You should be going home.
I'm glad I could see you.

00:11:17.580 --> 00:11:19.310
Mind if a grab a seat?

00:11:19.310 --> 00:11:19.940
Huh?

00:11:20.460 --> 00:11:22.210
Yeah, go right ahead.

00:11:22.210 --> 00:11:24.470
I'll take a beer. And a pizza.

00:11:24.470 --> 00:11:27.270
Any kind, as long as there are no olives.

00:11:27.720 --> 00:11:30.490
Don't mind me. Go about your reading.

00:11:30.490 --> 00:11:32.400
Oh, thanks...

00:11:43.020 --> 00:11:46.310
What? You still can't find Angelina?!

00:11:46.310 --> 00:11:48.480
Don't even think about
coming back here until you do!

00:11:49.230 --> 00:11:51.510
Is she at that guy's place again?!

00:11:51.510 --> 00:11:54.060
Sir, my apologies.

00:11:54.060 --> 00:11:56.960
This is all because I took my eyes off her...

00:11:58.460 --> 00:11:59.920
Miss!

00:12:02.970 --> 00:12:04.170
Father...

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:09.890
Do you understand me?!

00:12:09.890 --> 00:12:12.510
From now on your meals
will be brought to your room,

00:12:12.510 --> 00:12:15.560
and you'll be watched everywhere you go!

00:12:18.620 --> 00:12:19.860
Brad...

00:12:23.840 --> 00:12:25.560
What's this book you're all into?

00:12:26.720 --> 00:12:28.470
It's a romance novel.

00:12:28.470 --> 00:12:30.600
Hmmm... any good?

00:12:30.600 --> 00:12:32.140
Yeah, really good.

00:12:32.140 --> 00:12:35.450
One person's love for
another is a wonderful thing.

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:37.820
True love is a thing of beauty!

00:12:39.460 --> 00:12:40.630
Do you find that strange?

00:12:41.080 --> 00:12:43.420
--No.
--One beer.

00:12:43.840 --> 00:12:47.710
Took long enough for
just a beer... And my pizza?

00:12:47.710 --> 00:12:49.210
They're making it now.

00:12:49.210 --> 00:12:49.900
Damn...

00:12:52.380 --> 00:12:54.930
--Cheers.
--Uh, yeah, cheers.

00:13:06.940 --> 00:13:10.160
By the way, you seem kind
of like a drifter...

00:13:10.160 --> 00:13:11.510
Where are you from?

00:13:14.530 --> 00:13:17.120
You don't have to answer
that if you don't want to.

00:13:19.720 --> 00:13:21.500
Well, I'm going to be on my way.

00:13:24.480 --> 00:13:26.250
Here's your pizza. Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:13:26.670 --> 00:13:28.470
Hey, there's olives on this thing.

00:13:28.470 --> 00:13:29.740
Of course there are.

00:13:30.320 --> 00:13:31.230
Dammit.

00:13:43.610 --> 00:13:46.340
They say the gate will open tonight!

00:13:47.160 --> 00:13:48.180
Will it, now?

00:13:48.180 --> 00:13:53.320
But having to leave the human
world is kind of a shame...

00:13:53.890 --> 00:13:57.200
So you really were the one responsible
for that string of murders?

00:13:57.210 --> 00:14:01.210
I'm very fond of the blood of the living...

00:14:01.900 --> 00:14:03.090
Who's there?!

00:14:05.550 --> 00:14:06.670
Did you follow me?

00:14:07.680 --> 00:14:11.360
Eating a large pizza in five minutes
is a new personal record for me.

00:14:11.880 --> 00:14:14.090
Don't you mess with me!

00:14:15.420 --> 00:14:17.990
That's some handshake.

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:31.540
You're as strong as I'd heard.

00:14:31.540 --> 00:14:34.570
You make it sound like you know who I am.

00:14:34.570 --> 00:14:37.430
I've been in the living
world for a month now.

00:14:37.430 --> 00:14:40.750
I've heard the rumors about
Dante, "The Devil Hunter."

00:14:41.070 --> 00:14:45.460
So I guess I can take that as a
confession that you're not human, right?

00:14:46.070 --> 00:14:46.840
Yes.

00:14:47.800 --> 00:14:51.210
Well, then I guess you've got no objections.

00:14:51.210 --> 00:14:54.710
Correct. I don't imagine I could escape you.

00:14:55.220 --> 00:14:58.410
But there's just one thing I have to ask.

00:14:58.410 --> 00:14:59.180
What's that?

00:14:59.180 --> 00:15:03.050
I heard that you're a half-breed...
Born from the union of a human and a devil.

00:15:03.480 --> 00:15:06.660
If that's so, can you tell me...
were your parents in love?

00:15:07.290 --> 00:15:08.970
Was there love between human and devil?

00:15:08.970 --> 00:15:09.750
Who knows?

00:15:10.310 --> 00:15:13.680
One always hears stories about married couples
who look like they were made for each other,

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:15.440
but whose hearts are really cold as ice.

00:15:15.440 --> 00:15:15.950
That's not what...

00:15:15.950 --> 00:15:20.920
But, to me it looked as if they truly loved
one another from the bottom of their hearts.

00:15:21.840 --> 00:15:22.930
Really?

00:15:23.540 --> 00:15:25.080
Was that all you wanted to say?

00:15:25.720 --> 00:15:26.550
Yeah.

00:15:55.740 --> 00:15:58.540
I thought you might try to
pull a surprise attack on me.

00:15:58.540 --> 00:16:00.850
I know I can't defeat you.

00:16:00.850 --> 00:16:02.860
You're kind of a wimp for being a devil...

00:16:04.610 --> 00:16:09.000
Even though I am a devil,
there's no way I could fight you.

00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:12.060
Besides, my role here is finished.

00:16:12.370 --> 00:16:13.660
Finished?

00:16:13.660 --> 00:16:18.690
Tonight, my master from the
demon world will come to this world.

00:16:19.170 --> 00:16:23.790
A certain human summoned me
here to make those preparations.

00:16:23.790 --> 00:16:25.750
Why are you telling me this?

00:16:26.580 --> 00:16:30.110
Maybe because I want you
to put an end to it...

00:16:30.110 --> 00:16:31.700
My master's greedy.

00:16:32.120 --> 00:16:34.940
I'm sure he'll try to
devour this entire city.

00:16:36.320 --> 00:16:37.870
That café with the wonderful coffee...

00:16:38.620 --> 00:16:40.790
And the hill with such a
beautiful view of the setting sun...

00:16:42.280 --> 00:16:43.600
Everything...

00:16:46.040 --> 00:16:47.650
And Angelina too?

00:16:48.290 --> 00:16:52.430
What should I do? I don't want to lose her...

00:16:52.430 --> 00:16:54.290
She was so kind to me.

00:16:54.290 --> 00:16:56.380
I've always been treated so
cruelly in the demon world,

00:16:57.030 --> 00:16:59.130
but she'd smile at me.

00:16:59.730 --> 00:17:03.350
I don't even want to think about
the possibility of her being devoured.

00:17:04.210 --> 00:17:06.890
But... I'm a devil.

00:17:07.440 --> 00:17:09.150
I don't have the power to defy my master.

00:17:10.730 --> 00:17:15.620
It's true, you're pretty
pathetic... for a devil.

00:17:16.030 --> 00:17:21.090
But if you're capable of that much love for
Angelina, you'll be able to live as a human.

00:17:22.180 --> 00:17:25.050
A human? Me?

00:17:25.320 --> 00:17:26.990
--Take me there.
--Huh?

00:17:27.590 --> 00:17:29.750
To the gate that is tied to the demon world.

00:17:35.210 --> 00:17:36.430
Father?

00:17:36.430 --> 00:17:38.390
Father?! What happened?!

00:17:48.940 --> 00:17:49.970
Father!

00:17:52.060 --> 00:17:53.330
Father?!

00:17:54.530 --> 00:17:55.460
Father!

00:17:57.230 --> 00:17:58.700
Father!

00:17:58.970 --> 00:18:01.220
Father! Father!

00:18:01.220 --> 00:18:03.100
Hang on, Father!

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:04.600
Don't move.

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:06.930
If you had just stayed in
your room like a good girl,

00:18:06.930 --> 00:18:09.360
you could have died
without having to feel fear...

00:18:10.020 --> 00:18:12.090
Y-You... Why would you
do something like this?

00:18:12.090 --> 00:18:18.840
Soon, a powerful devil will be summoned
to this city by the ritual I have performed.

00:18:22.080 --> 00:18:26.690
Together we shall destroy this world!

00:18:53.600 --> 00:18:54.930
Dante!

00:18:54.930 --> 00:18:57.930
Sorry. I guess I knocked a little too hard...

00:18:57.930 --> 00:19:02.220
I had a bad feeling about you from
the moment I saw you with the mayor.

00:19:02.630 --> 00:19:04.440
But you're too late!

00:19:07.830 --> 00:19:08.730
Angelina!

00:19:08.730 --> 00:19:09.560
Brad!

00:19:10.600 --> 00:19:12.270
Sir, hang in there!

00:19:12.270 --> 00:19:16.110
Brad! Do you plan to betray Belphagor?!

00:19:21.550 --> 00:19:25.890
You're already too late!
Belphagor will be here soon!

00:19:44.700 --> 00:19:46.880
I'm sure it must have
been a long, hard journey...

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:55.930
Too bad entry here is restricted.

00:19:55.930 --> 00:19:58.520
Sorry, but I'm going to
have to ask you to leave!

00:20:16.010 --> 00:20:16.910
Angelina!

00:20:17.460 --> 00:20:18.640
Father!

00:20:19.230 --> 00:20:20.730
What is this...?

00:20:20.730 --> 00:20:23.290
Don't try to speak, Father.

00:20:23.290 --> 00:20:24.790
Brad, please!

00:20:24.790 --> 00:20:29.610
Okay. I've never tried it on a wound
as serious as this, but I'll try my best.

00:20:30.220 --> 00:20:34.420
What... do you think
you're doing to me... you devil...

00:20:35.310 --> 00:20:39.210
Do you think... that by doing this for me...

00:20:39.210 --> 00:20:42.220
I'm going to allow you to... see my daughter?

00:20:42.220 --> 00:20:43.520
Father!

00:20:43.910 --> 00:20:47.750
Don't worry yourself.
That is not what I'm thinking.

00:20:47.750 --> 00:20:53.120
No, I'm doing this simply because
I don't want to see Angelina sad.

00:20:53.120 --> 00:20:57.840
Mr. Mayor, sorry, but it doesn't look like
I'm going to be able to grant your request.

00:20:57.840 --> 00:20:59.680
Brad understands love.

00:20:59.680 --> 00:21:02.720
He'll make it just fine as a human.

00:21:02.720 --> 00:21:06.180
And the only things I
can exterminate are devils.

00:21:13.400 --> 00:21:15.800
Hey Morrison, haven't you got it fixed yet?

00:21:15.810 --> 00:21:17.390
Yeah, yeah, yeah...

00:21:17.390 --> 00:21:20.600
How much longer am I going to have to wait?!

00:21:20.600 --> 00:21:24.120
Just wait a little bit longer, okay, Miss?

00:21:27.280 --> 00:21:28.870
By the way, Dante...

00:21:29.290 --> 00:21:33.860
It's a nice story about how those
two finally got her dad's approval.

00:21:34.280 --> 00:21:41.760
But I don't see how your passing up on
the money should result in my fixing this TV...

00:21:41.760 --> 00:21:45.010
Less talking and more fixing!
My afternoon soap opera's about to start!

00:21:45.010 --> 00:21:46.230
Yes, Ma'am....

00:21:47.260 --> 00:21:48.450
You fixed it!

00:21:49.810 --> 00:21:52.630
I'll deduct my repair fees
from your next payment.

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:56.660
Whatever...

00:21:56.970 --> 00:21:58.560
Good grief.

00:21:58.560 --> 00:22:02.570
At this rate you'll never get your debt paid
off, no matter how many good jobs I bring you.

00:22:06.740 --> 00:22:09.130
But you seem happy, Dante...

00:22:09.130 --> 00:22:13.040
Even though you usually do nothing but
complain when you don't get your money...

00:22:13.810 --> 00:22:16.210
Every now and then there are days like this.

00:22:17.420 --> 00:22:20.910
I sure hope those two
will be happy, don't you?

00:24:02.410 --> 00:24:05.990
I've always had pretty bad luck with women.

00:24:06.610 --> 00:24:09.070
I'd be lucky if they'd just beat me up.

00:24:09.830 --> 00:24:14.490
But they'd also do things like stick swords
in my stomach, and shoot me in the forehead...

00:24:15.260 --> 00:24:18.200
If I wasn't who I am, I'd
probably be dead. Damn...

00:24:18.880 --> 00:24:21.640
And what's more, the women
that do those things

00:24:21.640 --> 00:24:23.850
